{UTF-8}
Work to Do= INTEG (
	Rework Discovery-Correct Completion-Flawed Completion,
		1000)
	~	Tasks
	~	The rework cycle (Cooper 1980; Sterman 2000 ch. 2; Lyneis and Ford 2007), written for SD Lab: flawed work is done, unseen, then found and redone.
	|
Work Done= INTEG (
	Correct Completion,
		0)
	~	Tasks
	~	Finished and correct; nothing leaves it.
	|
Undiscovered Rework= INTEG (
	Flawed Completion-Rework Discovery,
		0)
	~	Tasks
	~	Thought done, actually flawed; nobody measures it.
	|
Correct Completion=
	Quality*Work to Do/Completion Time
	~	Tasks/Week
	~	
	|
Flawed Completion=
	(1-Quality)*Work to Do/Completion Time
	~	Tasks/Week
	~	
	|
Rework Discovery=
	Undiscovered Rework/Discovery Time
	~	Tasks/Week
	~	
	|
Quality=
	0.75
	~	Dmnl
	~	Fraction of work done right first time.
	|
Completion Time=
	10
	~	Week
	~	
	|
Discovery Time=
	15
	~	Week
	~	
	|
********************************************************
	.Control
********************************************************~
		Simulation Control Parameters
	|
FINAL TIME  = 100
	~	Week
	~		|
INITIAL TIME  = 0
	~	Week
	~		|
SAVEPER  = 
        TIME STEP
	~	Week
	~		|
TIME STEP  = 1
	~	Week
	~		|
